In article <1992Jan7.150656.1023@dcs.glasgow.ac.uk> barrc@dcs.glasgow.ac.uk (Colin Barr) writes:
>I am down on level 26, and have walked into a lit room with a sleeping Medusa.
>Unfortunatley I do not have a blindfold.
>
>How can I kill her without getting stoned ?
>
Assuming you don't have a potion of blindness :-)

1.) Blind yourself by engraving with a wand of lightning

2.) Blind yourself by repeatedly applying a cursed unicorn horn and
    applying a normal horn for anything other than blindness.

3.) Polymorph into an ochre jelly or yellow dragon and kill her.

4.) Read a cursed scroll of genocide and ask for yellow lights.

5.) Apply a camera at yourself (.)

6.) If you have stealth, sneak up on her and apply a mirror at her.
    (watch out for squeaky boards!!)

7.) Ignore her for now.  Use a pickaxe, wand of digging, or level
    teleport past her level -- just remember to get a blindfold, or
    something before you come back up.

8.) If you have teleport control, a cursed teleport scroll, and one
    other quick teleport (wand, scroll, intrinsic), wander back
    upstairs and either find a yellow light, or rob a shop and get
    a cream pie in the face.  Then quickly level teleport with the
    cursed scroll to her level, teleport next to her, and kill her
    before the blindness wears off.  Another idea is to try to drink
    from a sink until it gives you a potion of blindness effect -
    again, you'll need teleport to get back quickly.


There's probably a few other ways too, but this should get you started.
